Screen Open 0,320,200,8,Lowres
Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 1
Screen Open 1,640,200,4,Hires : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 2 : Ink 3 : Circle 320,100,90
Print #1,Screen;Screen Width;Screen Height;Screen Colour;Screen Base>0
Screen 0 : Print #1,Screen;Screen Width(1);Screen Height(1)
Screen Open 2,320,256,32,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off
For I=0 To 31 : Ink I : Bar I*10,0 To I*10+9,255 : Next I
Print #1,Colour(5);Colour(31) : Colour 5,$123 : Print #1,Colour(5)
Get Palette 1 : Print #1,Colour(2)
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/screens_1.iff"
Screen Open 3,320,200,64,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off
Print #1,Screen Colour
For I=0 To 63 : Ink I : Bar (I mod 16)*20,(I/16)*50 To (I mod 16)*20+19,(I/16)*50+49 : Next I
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/screens_2.iff"
Screen Open 4,320,200,4096,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Print #1,Screen Colour
Cls 0 : For I=0 To 15 : Ink I : Bar I*20,0 To I*20+19,199 : Next I
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/screens_3.iff"
Screen Close 4 : Screen Close 3
Screen 2 : Double Buffer : Cls 0 : Ink 7 : Bar 10,10 To 100,100 : Screen Swap : Wait Vbl
Cls 0 : Ink 8 : Bar 50,50 To 150,150 : Screen Swap : Wait Vbl
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/screens_4.iff"
Screen To Front 0 : Screen To Back 0 : Screen Hide 1 : Screen Show 1
Screen Display 1,150,60,320,150 : Screen Offset 1,100,0 : View
Print #1,X Screen(10);Y Screen(10);X Hard(1,0);Y Hard(1,0)
Screen 1 : Gr Writing 1 : Ink 1 : Bar 0,0 To 99,99
Gr Writing 2 : Ink 2 : Bar 50,50 To 149,149
Gr Writing 0 : Ink 3,0 : Text 200,50,"jam1"
Gr Writing 1 : Ink 1,2 : Text 200,70,"jam2"
Set Pattern 3 : Ink 1 : Bar 300,10 To 400,90 : Set Pattern 0
Set Line $F0F0 : Draw 0,190 To 639,190 : Set Line $FFFF
Set Paint 1 : Ink 2,0,1 : Bar 420,10 To 520,90
Set Text 1 : Text 200,120,"bold" : Set Text 2 : Text 200,140,"italic" : Set Text 4 : Text 300,140,"under"
Print #1,Text Base;Text Length("abcd")
Set Text 0
Save Iff "AMOSTEST:out/screens_5.iff"
